        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://iagenweb.org/madison/towns_townships/towns/macksburg.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The WRC Hall, where women met until 2002, is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
